# AI-Suplex Labs — domain redirects
#
# www.ai-suplex.co.zw is handled by Netlify's domain-level setting
# ("Redirects automatically to primary domain"), so it is NOT repeated here.
#
# ai-suplexlabs.co.zw was added as a Netlify *domain alias*, which SERVES the same
# content rather than redirecting. These rules force a 301 to the canonical primary
# domain so there is exactly one host serving the site.

https://ai-suplexlabs.co.zw/*      https://ai-suplex.co.zw/:splat   301!
https://www.ai-suplexlabs.co.zw/*  https://ai-suplex.co.zw/:splat   301!
